DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nAries Spears LIVE at Funny Bone – Omaha\nGet ready
	 for a night of non-stop laughs as stand-up comedy powerhouse Aries Spears
	 takes the stage at Funny Bone Comedy Club in Omaha\, Nebraska. Known for 
	his razor-sharp wit and explosive energy\, Aries Spears delivers a comedy 
	experience you won’t forget. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, July 18\, 2
	026\nTime: 6:30 PM (Doors open at 5:30 PM)\nVenue: Funny Bone Comedy Club\
	, 710 N 114th St\, Suite 210\, Omaha\, NE 68154\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Val
	id photo ID required)\nTicket Price: $37 – $42 \nAbout Aries Spears\nAries
	 Spears is a veteran stand-up comedian and actor best known for his long r
	un on MADtv\, where his uncanny celebrity impressions made him a household
	 name. With decades of experience on stage and screen\, Spears brings a hi
	gh-energy\, no-holds-barred style to every performance. He has appeared on
	 numerous TV specials and continues to tour nationally to sold-out crowds.
	 \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from a MADtv legend\nHila
	rious celebrity impressions and sharp observational humor\nAn intimate com
	edy club atmosphere\nFull bar and dinner menu available\nA perfect Saturda
	y night out with friends or a date\n\nTicket Information\nTickets for the 
	Saturday 6:30 PM early show start at $37. Seating is general admission. \n
	Official Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We 
	earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra co
	st to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo
	 ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/aries-s
	pears-live-at-funny-bone-comedy-club-omaha-sat-early/\n\nFrom Comedy Calen
	dar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/aries-spears-live-at-funny-bone-comedy
	-club-omaha-sat-early/
LOCATION:Funny Bone Comedy Club – Omaha\, 710 N 114th St Suite 210\, Omaha\
	, NE\, 68154
