SUMMARY:Andrew Dismukes LIVE at Punch Line Philly (Saturday Show)
DTSTAMP:20260718T100446Z
DTSTART:20260718T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout Andrew Dis
	mukes\nAndrew Dismukes is one of comedy’s most exciting rising talents\, w
	idely recognized from his time as a cast member on Saturday Night Live. Hi
	s ability to inhabit bizarre characters while maintaining sharp comedic ti
	ming made him a standout on the show\, and his live stand-up performances 
	are even more impressive. \nHailing from Texas\, Dismukes brings a uniquel
	y deadpan yet explosive energy to the stage. His comedy weaves together ab
	surdist premises\, relatable observations\, and unexpected twists that kee
	p audiences laughing throughout the entire set. \nSaturday nights at Punch
	 Line Philly are always electric\, and Andrew Dismukes is the perfect head
	liner to make this one unforgettable. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, Ju
	ly 18\, 2026 \nShow Time: 7:00 PM \nVenue: Punch Line Philly — 33 E. Laure
	l Street\, Philadelphia\, PA 19123 \nAge Restrictions: 18+ (valid ID requi
	red) \nContent Warning: Adult language and themes \nAbout the Venue\nPunch
	 Line Philly is Philadelphia’s top comedy destination\, located at 33 E. L
	aurel Street in the vibrant Northern Liberties neighborhood. The club seat
	s approximately 300 guests in an intimate\, purpose-built comedy setting w
	ith excellent sightlines and acoustics from every seat. \nThe venue offers
	 a full bar and food menu\, making it easy to enjoy a complete night out. 
	Saturday shows at Punch Line Philly are especially popular\, drawing enthu
	siastic crowds ready for a great time. Parking is available nearby\, and t
	he venue is accessible by public transit. \nPunch Line Philly has earned i
	ts reputation as one of the best comedy clubs on the East Coast\, consiste
	ntly booking top-tier national talent in an atmosphere that feels both pro
	fessional and welcoming. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up perform
	ance by Andrew Dismukes running approximately 60–75 minutes. His Saturday 
	show is known for being especially high-energy\, with the weekend crowd br
	inging an infectious enthusiasm that elevates the entire performance. \nDo
	ors open approximately 30–45 minutes before showtime. Arrive early to secu
	re your spot\, order a drink\, and enjoy the pre-show atmosphere. A two-dr
	ink minimum applies at most tables. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $52
	 – $112 (fees included) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (offi
	cial) and VividSeats (resale). Saturday shows sell out fast — secure your 
	seats now! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate
	 links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comed
	ycalendar.com/event/andrew-dismukes-live-at-punch-line-philly-july-eightee
	n/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/andrew-dismukes-live-at-punch-line-phi
	lly-july-eighteen/
LOCATION:Punch Line Philly\, 33 E. Laurel Street\, Philadelphia\, PA\, 1912
	3\, United States
