	ckets\nResale Tickets \nJerry Seinfeld LIVE at Premier Theater at Foxwoods
	 Resort Casino\nOne of the greatest stand-up comedians of all time\, Jerry
	 Seinfeld\, brings his legendary live show to the Premier Theater at Foxwo
	ods Resort Casino in Mashantucket\, CT on July 18\, 2026. Known for his sh
	arp observational humor and impeccable timing\, Seinfeld continues to sell
	 out venues worldwide with his signature wit and storytelling. \nEvent Det
	ails\nDate: Saturday\, July 18\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM ET (Doors open at 7:0
	0 PM)\nVenue: Premier Theater at Foxwoods Resort Casino\nAddress: 39 Norwi
	ch Westerly Road\, Mashantucket\, CT 06339\nAge Requirement: All Ages\nPar
	king: On-site parking available \nAbout Jerry Seinfeld\nJerry Seinfeld is 
	one of the most successful and beloved comedians in the world\, best known
	 for co-creating and starring in the iconic NBC sitcom Seinfeld\, which ra
	n from 1989 to 1998 and remains one of the greatest TV shows ever made. Be
	yond television\, Seinfeld has never stopped performing stand-up comedy\, 
	releasing acclaimed specials including 23 Hours to Kill (2020) on Netflix.
	 His observational comedy about everyday life\, relationships\, and the qu
	irks of modern existence has made him a timeless voice in comedy. \nWhat t
	o Expect\n\nWorld-class stand-up comedy from a true legend of the craft\nS
	harp\, observational humor about everyday life and human behavior\nImpecca
	ble comedic timing honed over decades of performing\nAn intimate theater s
	etting at the Premier Theater at Foxwoods\nA night of non-stop laughter yo
	u won’t soon forget\nOne of the most sought-after live comedy experiences 
	of 2026\n\nVenue Information\nThe Premier Theater at Foxwoods Resort Casin
	o is one of New England’s premier entertainment venues\, located within th
	e world-famous Foxwoods Resort Casino in Mashantucket\, Connecticut. The t
	heater offers excellent sightlines\, top-notch acoustics\, and a full-serv
	ice casino resort experience before and after the show. \nTicket Informati
	on\nTickets for Jerry Seinfeld at Foxwoods start at $137. This is a highly
	 anticipated show — tickets are expected to sell out quickly. Secure your 
	seats now through official Ticketmaster or resale options via VividSeats. 
	\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. W
	e earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra 
