DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nMaz Jobrani is one of the most celebrated Iranian-American comedians 
	working today\, known for his sharp wit\, cultural observations\, and abil
	ity to bridge worlds through laughter. \nA founding member of the legendar
	y Axis of Evil Comedy Tour\, Maz has built a career on turning his immigra
	nt experience into universal comedy gold. His stand-up tackles everything 
	from family dynamics and cultural clashes to politics and everyday absurdi
	ties — all delivered with warmth\, energy\, and precision timing. \nMaz ha
	s appeared on numerous TV shows and films\, including his own Netflix spec
	ial “Brown and Friendly\,” and has been a regular on late-night television
	. His comedy resonates deeply with diverse audiences who appreciate his ab
	ility to find humor in the human condition regardless of background. \nEve
	nt Details\nDate: Saturday\, July 18\, 2026 \nTime: 8:00 PM \nVenue: Sound
	 Board at MotorCity Casino Hotel \nAddress: 2901 Grand River Ave\, Detroit
	\, MI 48201 \nAge Restrictions: Please check venue for age requirements. \
	nAbout the Venue\nThe Sound Board at MotorCity Casino Hotel is one of Detr
	oit’s premier intimate concert and comedy venues\, nestled inside the vibr
	ant MotorCity Casino Hotel complex on Grand River Avenue. \nWith a capacit
	y of approximately 1\,700 guests\, the Sound Board offers an exceptional v
	iewing experience from virtually every seat in the house. The venue featur
	es state-of-the-art sound and lighting systems\, a full bar\, and a sophis
	ticated atmosphere that sets the stage for an unforgettable night out. \nT
	he MotorCity Casino Hotel complex provides ample amenities including on-si
	te parking\, multiple dining options\, and the full casino experience befo
	re or after the show. The venue is easily accessible from downtown Detroit
	 and surrounding suburbs. \nWhat to Expect\nMaz Jobrani delivers a high-en
	ergy\, crowd-pleasing performance that blends personal storytelling with s
	harp social commentary. Expect plenty of laughs about cultural identity\, 
	family life\, and the quirks of modern American society. \nHis shows are k
	nown for their inclusive atmosphere — Maz has a gift for making everyone i
	n the room feel seen and heard\, regardless of their background. This is a
	 solo stand-up performance\, so you’ll get a full evening of Maz at his be
	st. \nThe intimate setting of the Sound Board means you’ll be close to the
	 action\, making for a truly personal comedy experience. Arrive early to g
	rab a drink and settle in before the show begins. \nTicket Information\nPr
	ice Range: From $60 (resale prices may vary) \nSecure your seats now befor
	e they sell out. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and
	 VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nhttps://comedyca
	lendar.com/event/maz-jobrani-live-at-sound-board-at-motorcity-casino-hotel
	/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
