DESCRIPTION:So Lit Saturday: nonstop comedy\, guaranteed seating\, shots\, 
	and a Miami afterparty that keeps the night alive. Free Shots at 9PM.\n\n\
	nSO LIT Saturday at Blackbird Ordinary 🔥\n \nHere’s how to start off your 
	Saturday nights…in one of the best nightclubs in Brickell. \nWe’re setting
	 the weekend on fire with comedy\, cocktails\, and crowdwork\, all happeni
	ng inside Blackbird Ordinary\, Miami’s most iconic nightlife spot. \n🎤 Com
	edy Show | 9–10:30PMThe night kicks off in the back room\, where it transf
	orms into a full-blown comedy club. Hosted by Manny Garavito (Miami’s Best
	 Comedian) and JJ (Manny’s favorite Miami comedian)\, expect laughs that g
	o from wild to wild af real quick. \nThese two have spent years building M
	iami’s funniest nights\, and now they’re bringing the energy\, the people\
	, and the afterparty vibes all under one roof. \nTicket Options \nFree Sea
	tingFirst come\, first served. Whatever seats are not purchased will be av
	ailable to anyone who arrives early. Once they’re gone\, they’re gone. \n$
	25 Guaranteed Seating + FREE Shot After 9pmSecure your spot without rushin
	g. We’ll hold your seats until you arrive and welcome you with your shot e
	ven if you show up after 9 PM. Limited seating available. \n$50 VIP Experi
	ence (Guaranteed Seating\, FREE Shot After 9PM\, VIP Bottle Afterparty Acc
	ess AND Merch)Everything included: guaranteed seating\, a free shot even a
	fter 9 PM\, access to our bottle section for the afterparty with Manny and
	 JJ\, plus exclusive Miami Comedy merch to take home. VERY Limited space. 
	\n \nThis is So Lit Saturday at Blackbird Ordinary—where Brickell weekends
	 hit different.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/so-lit-saturday-blackb
	ird-ordinary-comedy-night-22/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
