	dy today. Best known as a cast member on Saturday Night Live\, Dismukes ea
	rned a devoted following with his sharp character work\, absurdist humor\,
	 and impeccable comedic timing. \nA Texas native\, he brings a uniquely de
	adpan yet explosive energy to the stage. His live stand-up goes deeper tha
	n what you’ve seen on TV — expect personal storytelling\, ridiculous premi
	ses\, and a performance style that keeps the audience completely engaged f
	rom start to finish. \nThe Saturday late show at Punch Line Philly is the 
	perfect way to end your weekend on a high note. Andrew Dismukes is guarant
	eed to deliver a night you won’t forget. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\,
	 July 18\, 2026 \nShow Time: 9:15 PM (Late Show) \nVenue: Punch Line Phill
	y — 33 E. Laurel Street\, Philadelphia\, PA 19123 \nAge Restrictions: 18+ 
	(valid ID required) \nContent Warning: Adult language and themes \nAbout t
	he Venue\nPunch Line Philly is Philadelphia’s most celebrated comedy club\
	, located at 33 E. Laurel Street in the Northern Liberties neighborhood. T
	he intimate venue holds approximately 300 guests in a setting designed spe
	cifically for stand-up comedy\, with excellent sightlines and acoustics fr
	om every seat. \nThe club features a full bar and food menu\, so you can e
	njoy cocktails\, craft beers\, and bites throughout the show. Saturday lat
	e shows at Punch Line Philly are legendary for their electric atmosphere —
	 the crowd is always ready to have a great time\, and the energy in the ro
	om is unmatched. \nParking is available nearby\, and the venue is easily a
	ccessible by public transit. Punch Line Philly is consistently ranked amon
	g the best comedy clubs on the East Coast. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a sol
	o stand-up performance by Andrew Dismukes running approximately 60–75 minu
	tes. The Saturday late show crowd is always one of the most enthusiastic o
	f the weekend\, creating an incredible shared experience between performer
	 and audience. \nDoors open approximately 30 minutes before showtime. Arri
	ve early to grab a drink and find your seat. A two-drink minimum applies a
	t most tables. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $52 – $112 (fees include
	d) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats 
	(resale). Saturday late shows sell out extremely fast — grab your tickets 
	now before they’re gone! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post cont
	ains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\
	nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/andrew-dismukes-live-at-punch-line-phill
