	ay\, July 19\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch L
	ine Comedy Club – Sacramento\nAddress: 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95
	825\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Li
	ne Comedy Club Sacramento is Northern California’s most celebrated comedy 
	destination. Located at 2100 Arden Way\, this intimate club has been a cor
	nerstone of the Sacramento comedy scene for decades\, hosting legends and 
	rising stars alike. \nThe venue features general admission and preferred p
	remium seating\, a full bar\, and the classic two-drink minimum. The cozy 
	room ensures every audience member gets an up-close\, personal experience.
	 Parking is available in the adjacent shopping center lot. \nWhat to Expec
	t\nThis is a solo headline stand-up performance by Joey Avery. Expect a fu
	n\, high-energy evening of stand-up comedy with sharp observations and eng
	aging crowd interaction. Shows run approximately 75–90 minutes. The 18+ po
	licy and beverage minimum are in effect. \nTicket Information\nTickets ran
	ge from approximately $52 – $75 (all-in pricing\, fees included before tax
	es). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links
